<!-- PURPLE TRACK -->
<trk>
<name>Purple Route - Waterfall Trail</name>
<desc>Trail to spectacular Cascade Falls. Creek crossings, slippery when wet. Best flow May-June. 3.8 miles, 600 feet elevation gain.</desc>
