<!-- YELLOW TRACK -->
<trk>
<name>Yellow Route - Meadow Traverse</name>
<desc>Alpine meadow traverse with wildflower displays. Peak bloom mid-July. Watch for mountain goats. 6.5 miles, 1,400 feet elevation gain.</desc>
